            {
              "prompt": "The same fisherman on the same boat, the same camera rocking with the deck. The towering wave peaks and crests over the bow — foam surges straight into the lens, the deck pitches hard down the backside of the swell, and the fisherman rides it out at the rail as another roller builds on the horizon. Visceral, relentless, a single unbroken take.",
